  "$Comment": "Elsie the Weaver's winter look for Christmas, every piece of it the game's own: the same player's body and face as her Harvest Feast look (Models/Harvest_Feast/NPC/Harvest_Feast_Weaver.json), her copper hair let down under a red striped beanie, the character creator's winter jacket dyed green over her villager shirt, a large white scarf, her brown trousers and buckled shoes. Parent Seasons_Of_Orbis_Villager brings the player's body, its animations and its hitbox, and the wave she greets a player with. The body, face, mouth and ears share one skin tone (GradientSet Skin, GradientId 03): keep it the same as her feast look, so she reads as one woman in two seasons. DefaultAttachments replaces the parent's list whole, so the face pieces come first. Her summer bun would poke through the beanie, so the hair here is the creator's GenericMedium, the cut it falls back to under a hat. A greyscale texture takes its colour from GradientSet and GradientId, the dyes the character creator offers players: change a GradientId to re-dye one piece. The role Christmas_Weaver names this model, and her placement wears that role while only Christmas runs.",
